  "Do not use listing_risk merely because delisting, deregistration, or reduced public float is a consequence of a going-private or tender transaction. Use listing_risk only when loss of listing, trading suspension, exchange compliance, or deregistration risk is the central event.",
  "Use legal_risk only when litigation, injunction, regulatory action, appraisal/dissenters' rights dispute, settlement, enforcement, or coercive/minority-holder legal risk dominates or materially changes the offer.",
  "Use financial_risk only when financing condition, failed financing, solvency, liquidity stress, distress, default, covenant pressure, or balance sheet pressure dominates the filing.",
  "Use shareholder_vote only when the central substance is a meeting, vote recommendation, vote result, consent solicitation, or approval failure. Do not use it merely because a transaction has a vote condition.",
  "Use dilution_risk only when rights-offering dilution, new securities issuance, exchange-ratio dilution, financing recapitalization, or employee option-exchange dilution/overhang is central. Do not use it merely because stock is used as consideration.",
